    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d95-a1">

                <pb facs="0265" n="1225" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1225"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No.
                    134.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mariscal to Mr.
                            Bragg.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-08-29"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 29,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: Referring to your excellency’s
                    note dated the 29th of last May, and relative to an encounter had between
                    Mexicans and Papago Indians on the Sonora frontier, I have the honor to inclose
                    with this note copy of a report thereon received by me from the governor of said
                    State.</p>
                <p>I protest to your excellency, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Igno. Mariscal</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
